==Descriptions==
A secluded island situated in the southeastern ocean of Jinzhou territory. Cloaked in mist, it obscures its connection to the secular world. Mt. Firmament serves as the ancestral homeland of Jinzhou inhabitants. Legend has it that Sentinel "Jué" descended here to guide them. Navigating its waters is treacherous due to the thick fog. To safely reach its shores, you'll need to wait for precise timing and the expertise of a "Wayfinder".
A sanctuary in the southeastern seas of Jinzhou, sealed away beyond the reach of common folks in thick fogs. According to ancient records, Mt. Firmament is the ancestral home of Jinzhou's earliest settlers. Sentinel Jué once descended upon this land, using the power of Temporal Mandate to protect it from Tacet Discords. Consequently, the flow of time within Mt. Firmament diverges from that of the outside world. In earlier times, scholars from the Court of Savantae were fortunate enough to uncover the mountain's hidden mysteries, leaving behind research facilities and invaluable records before vanishing without a trace.

